### 📄 Get all vendors
GET http://localhost:5000/api/vendors
Accept: application/json

###

### 📄 Get active vendors only
GET http://localhost:5000/api/vendors?isActive=true
Accept: application/json

###

### 🔍 Search vendor by name
GET http://localhost:5000/api/vendors?search=CRATING
Accept: application/json

###

### 🔍 Get vendor by id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/vendors/1
Accept: application/json

###

### ❌ Invalid id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/vendors/abc
Accept: application/json


### 🚚 Vendor scan - start crating
POST http://localhost:5000/api/vendors/scan/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": 1,
  "areaId": 1,
  "pic": "vendor_user_1"
}

###

### ✅ Vendor scan - finish crating
POST http://localhost:5000/api/vendors/scan/finish
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": 1,
  "pic": "vendor_user_1"
}
